Description: Provides a lightweight and flexible framework for k-fold
    cross-validation that works with arbitrary model fitting functions,
    prediction routines, and evaluation metrics. Supports user-defined
    preprocessing pipelines for both predictors and responses, and is
    designed to be easily extensible for machine learning tasks.
